00:23:45,966 --> 00:23:47,385
Sure.

526
00:23:47,425 --> 00:23:49,553
Okay. Give me
60 seconds

527
00:23:49,595 --> 00:23:51,305
on the clock, please.

528
00:23:51,347 --> 00:23:53,933
Ready. Go.

529
00:23:53,974 --> 00:23:58,104
Oak, maple, elm, birch.

530
00:23:58,145 --> 00:24:00,147
I dunno...
Types of trees.

531
00:24:00,189 --> 00:24:02,358
( bell rings )

532
00:24:02,400 --> 00:24:06,362
Uh... Buenos dias.
Enchilada. Por favor.

533
00:24:06,404 --> 00:24:07,363
Oh, I'm sorry.

534
00:24:07,405 --> 00:24:09,365
I don't know any Spanish words.

535
00:24:09,407 --> 00:24:10,366
( bell rings )

536
00:24:10,408 --> 00:24:11,575
Wow.

537
00:24:11,617 --> 00:24:13,244
A match. A candle.

538
00:24:13,286 --> 00:24:15,453
Things that go "tsss"
when you put them out.

539
00:24:15,495 --> 00:24:16,705
A torch. A bonfire.

540
00:24:17,873 --> 00:24:18,958
Uh... Your pee.

541
00:24:18,999 --> 00:24:20,834
Things that burn!

542
00:24:20,876 --> 00:24:23,587
"I'd like to go for a walk."

543
00:24:23,629 --> 00:24:25,463
"Scratch my belly."

544
00:24:25,505 --> 00:24:27,591
Dude, dude, I think
you're losing it.

545
00:24:27,633 --> 00:24:28,801
"I have fur."

546
00:24:28,842 --> 00:24:30,468
"I like to bark."

547
00:24:30,510 --> 00:24:32,470
Oh, oh, oh. What a dog says.

548
00:24:32,512 --> 00:24:33,347
Peppero...

549
00:24:33,389 --> 00:24:35,057
Pizza toppings! Next!

550
00:24:36,350 --> 00:24:39,270
Cindy Crawford. Christie
Brinkley. Heidi Klum.

551
00:24:39,312 --> 00:24:40,562
Claudia Schiffer.

552
00:24:40,604 --> 00:24:41,730
Oh, oh, oh, oh!

553
00:24:41,772 --> 00:24:42,940
Christy Turlington.

554
00:24:42,982 --> 00:24:44,108
Uh, Kate Moss.

555
00:24:44,150 --> 00:24:45,609
Girls Chandler could never get?

556
00:24:45,651 --> 00:24:46,610
( buzzer )

557
00:24:46,652 --> 00:24:47,820
Supermodels.

558
00:24:47,861 --> 00:24:48,946
Where?

559
00:24:53,659 --> 00:24:55,453
Hey. Where's Rachel?

560
00:24:55,493 --> 00:24:58,747
She and Phoebe took
the stripper to the hospital.

561
00:25:00,333 --> 00:25:02,835
Did you know Chandler
kissed Rachel?

562
00:25:02,876 --> 00:25:05,296
What? When, when was this?.

563
00:25:05,338 --> 00:25:06,755
1987.

564
00:25:06,797 --> 00:25:09,175
The weekend you guys
visited me at school.

565
00:25:09,216 --> 00:25:10,468
Oh, my God. That's wild.

566
00:25:10,508 --> 00:25:11,677
Yeah, but it was like

567
00:25:11,718 --> 00:25:12,678
a million years ago,

568
00:25:12,719 --> 00:25:13,679
so it doesn't matter.

569
00:25:13,720 --> 00:25:14,680
Well, it matters to me.

570
00:25:14,721 --> 00:25:16,015
Why?

571
00:25:16,056 --> 00:25:17,515
Because the night
you kissed Rachel

572
00:25:17,557 --> 00:25:19,059
was the night
I kissed Rachel

573
00:25:19,101 --> 00:25:20,394
for the very first time.

574
00:25:20,436 --> 00:25:21,937
You kissed her
that night, too?

575
00:25:21,979 --> 00:25:23,230
Two guys in one night?

576
00:25:23,272 --> 00:25:25,024
Oh, I thought
she became a slut

577
00:25:25,065 --> 00:25:27,067
after she got her nose fixed.

578
00:25:28,526 --> 00:25:30,488
Seriously,
where did this happen?

579
00:25:30,528 --> 00:25:33,866
Okay, after you told me she
was passed out in our room,

580
00:25:33,907 --> 00:25:36,827
I went in there to make
sure she was all right.

581
00:25:36,869 --> 00:25:40,247
She was lying on my bed, all
buried in people's coats.

582
00:25:40,289 --> 00:25:42,500
Well, I-I went to kiss
her on the forehead,

583
00:25:42,540 --> 00:25:45,711
you know, but it was so dark
I accidentally got her lips.

584
00:25:45,752 --> 00:25:47,171
I started to pull away,

585
00:25:47,213 --> 00:25:49,298
but then I felt her
start to kiss me back.

586
00:25:49,340 --> 00:25:51,091
It was only for
a second, but...

587
00:25:51,133 --> 00:25:52,718
it was amazing

588
00:25:52,759 --> 00:25:55,888
and now, now I find out
that you kissed her first.

589
00:25:55,929 --> 00:25:57,681
Wait-- what bed
did you say she was on?

590
00:25:57,723 --> 00:25:59,266
Mine.

591
00:25:59,308 --> 00:26:00,893
I'm pretty sure
I put her on my bed.

592
00:26:00,934 --> 00:26:02,728
No, she was
definitely on my bed.

593
00:26:02,769 --> 00:26:06,440
Why would I kiss a girl
and then put her on your bed?

594
00:26:06,482 --> 00:26:08,150
Well, then, who
was on my bed?

595
00:26:08,192 --> 00:26:10,986
Oh! Oh! Oh!

596
00:26:12,029 --> 00:26:13,906
No! No, no!

597
00:26:13,947 --> 00:26:15,115
Yes!

598
00:26:16,534 --> 00:26:18,369
You were under
the pile of coats?

599
00:26:18,411 --> 00:26:21,163
I was the pile of coats.

600
00:26:24,208 --> 00:26:26,626
Oh, my God!

601
00:26:26,668 --> 00:26:30,672
You were
my mystery midnight kisser?!

602
00:26:30,714 --> 00:26:34,468
You were
my first kiss with Rachel?!

603
00:26:35,469 --> 00:26:38,222
You were my first kiss ever?!

604
00:26:40,807 --> 00:26:43,227
What did I
marry into?!

605
00:26:49,649 --> 00:26:53,611
( dance music playing )

606
00:26:53,653 --> 00:26:57,657
Captioned by
Media Access Group at WGBH
access.wgbh.org

607
00:27:17,677 --> 00:27:19,346
Aw, crap.

